"System->Administration->Add/Remove Software (Gnome) or "
"Applications->System->Software Management (KDE)."
msgstr ""
"Fedora-användare kan installera <span class=\"gnucash\">GnuCash</span> via "
"System → Administration → Lägg till/ta bort programvara (Gnome) eller "
"Program → System → Programhantering (KDE)."

#: download.phtml:37
msgid ""
"Mandriva users can install <span class=\"gnucash\">GnuCash</span> through "
"the Software Management in the Mandriva Linux Control Center."
msgstr ""
"Mandriva-användare kan installera <span class=\"gnucash\">GnuCash</span> via"
" Programhantering i Mandriva Linux kontrollcenter."

#: download.phtml:38
