"Software Center (Office Software -> Financial Software -> gnucash)."
msgstr ""
"Solus-användare kan installera <span class=\"gnucash\">GnuCash</span> via "
"programvarucentret (Kontorsprogram → Ekonomiprogram → gnucash)."

#: download.phtml:40
